# Ignore settings for Chezmoi
**/.DS_Store

## Emacs
# I use ~/.config/emacs/var to store package files.  Chezmoi shouldn't
# track these, as these are generated programmatically by the Emacs
# configuration.
~/.config/emacs/var/*

# Chezmoi also shouldn't track certain custom variables.
~/.config/emacs/custom.el
